{"version":1,"content":"<p>據知情人士透露，英偉達董事會出人意料地將黃仁勳復職的舉動並未事先徵詢公司高級管理層的意見，後者直到最後一刻才獲知該消息。知情人士表示，在美國總統特朗普向董事會成員施加政治壓力後，相關決定於周日下午作出。由於討論屬於非公開信息，知情人士要求匿名。他們還表示，一些原本被考慮接替黃仁勳的人選也退出了遴選程序。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587716.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T20:00:27.175910+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:38:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:30.182217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:30.182217+00:00","content_hash":"91a9da25aacfef9b6d327db644c34e29858d87716fde02afbf51b3f92b8987e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}